om/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113625177078772157.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The 10Y yield eased from about 5.3% to just above 5%.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 23</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
